\q{At the same time, allow me to send you two issues of the Bulletin de la \textit{Société française de philosophie}, which you probably do not see regularly. They contain Perrin’s lecture on the new measurements of atoms, as well as the ensuing discussion. I also took part in the discussion and, of course, I attempted to turn the situation to my own advantage. Although you will probably disagree with almost everything, you might perhaps be interested in certain aspects of the whole subject. Should you write anything about it (for which I would be very grateful), I kindly ask you to send me a copy}[\letterecndp{Meyerson}{Cassirer}{1}{12}{1912}[195]]
